[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraTeleports/assets/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraTeleports bundles every player teleport: TPA requests, safe random teleport, /back and the classic staff commands.
UltraTeleports is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]TPA and TPAHere with expiry and click-to-accept
[*]/back to your last location or death point
[*]Random teleport with async, safe location search per world
[*]Disable requests (/tptoggle) and ignore single players
[*]Warm-up, cooldown per teleport type and optional RTP costs (Vault / UltraEconomy)
[*]Staff commands: /tp, /tphere, /tpall
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in the language files.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraTeleports/assets/preview.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-languages.png[/IMG]

[B]English · Deutsch · Français · Nederlands · Italiano[/B]
Every player sees UltraTeleports in the language of their Minecraft client – automatically.
Players with any other language get your default language, which you set in the config or with [FONT=Courier New]/ultrateleports language <code>[/FONT].
All texts live in [FONT=Courier New]lang/<code>.yml[/FONT] and can be edited freely.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/tpa <spieler>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Send a teleport request [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.tpa)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/tpahere <spieler>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Request a player to come to you [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.tpahere)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/tpaccept · /tpdeny[/COLOR][/FONT] – Accept / deny a request [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.tpa)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/back[/COLOR][/FONT] – Return to your last location [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.back)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/rtp [welt][/COLOR][/FONT] – Random teleport [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.rtp)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/tptoggle[/COLOR][/FONT] – Toggle incoming requests [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.toggle)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/tpignore <spieler>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Ignore one player's requests [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.toggle)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/tp · /tphere · /tpall[/COLOR][/FONT] – Staff teleports [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.staff)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultrateleports <help|reload|version|language>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrateleports.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrateleports.bypass.warmup[/FONT] – Skip the warm-up
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrateleports.bypass.cooldown[/FONT] – Skip the cooldown
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrateleports.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraTeleports and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder. Works on [B]Spigot, Paper and Purpur 1.20.4+[/B] (Java 17+), no dependencies needed.
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and the files in [FONT=Courier New]lang/[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultrateleports reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

